    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Legion of Excess",
    "summary": "Your **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** units get this ability:\n\n**Seductive Gambit**: you can declare a Seductive Gambit for this unit whenever it finishes a [Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move). Once declared, these apply to it for the rest of the turn:\n\n- it does not have [Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first)\n- its models can re-roll their [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) and can re-roll 1s to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)",
